HEADER;
/*
  Component:  equal angle 40 x 40 x 4, L=50
  Standard:   EN 10056-1 equal angle section proportions
  Family:     steel angle section
  Size:       40x40x4
  Length:     50 mm
  Material:   steel (label only; not a structural claim)
  Data source: Angle-section geometry with a root fillet and toe radii. The 40 x 40 x 4 EN 10056 preset uses root radius 6 mm and toe radius 3 mm, confirmed against the step.parts reference.
  Notes:      Steel angle section with legs along +X and +Y, a concave root fillet, and rounded toe flats. End cuts, holes, and rolling tolerances are not modelled.
  Features modeled:      body, leg-a, leg-b, toe-radii
  Features approximated: root-fillet (PolylineArc, deviation 0.00722726276896557 mm, control root_fillet_segments=16 over 90 degrees)
  Features omitted:      mill-scale-and-tolerances (the section is nominal; rolling tolerances are not modelled); end-cuts-and-holes (no end machining or hole pattern is asserted)
  Feature tolerance:     0.01 mm
*/
FILE_DESCRIPTION(('equal angle 40 x 40 x 4, L=50'),'2;1');
